# 묻기 창 모양: 터미널 닫기 확인과 종료 묻기를 찍는다
resize 1200 760
waittabs 1 @30000
send echo ready\r
waitline ready @20000
key ctrl-shift-w
waitoverlay close-terminal @10000
wait 500
shot dialog-close
key escape
waitoverlay none @10000
closewindow
waitoverlay quit @10000
wait 500
shot dialog-quit
key escape
waitoverlay none @10000
quit
